OL,3,GNEWSACouncil land earmarked for housing
OL,4,Ato be sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plot of green space earmarked for 75
OL,7,Fhouses is to be sold by cash-strapped
OL,8,FBradford Council as it tries to improve
OL,9,Fits finances.
OL,11,FThe land, off Hainworth Wood Road,
OL,12,FHainworth Road and Gingerbread Clough
OL,13,Fin Keighley, is one of several assets
OL,14,Fit plans to sell.
OL,16,FThe Keighley site is included in
OL,17,FBradford's Draft Local Plan as having
OL,18,Fthe potential to support a 75-house
OL,19,Fdevelopment.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
