OL,3,GNEWSACouncil land earmarked for housing
OL,4,Ato be sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes two years after the government
OL,7,Fagreed to provide the council with
OL,8,F"exceptional financial support" and
OL,9,Fallowed it to sell off some assets to
OL,10,Ffund its day-to-day operations.
